@startuml
title Sequence - Logout

actor Player
participant "GUI (Dashboard)" as GUI
participant "SessionManager" as SM

Player -> GUI : click Logout
activate GUI

GUI -> SM : clearSession(sessionToken)
activate SM
SM --> GUI : sessionCleared
deactivate SM

GUI -> GUI : transition to Welcome/Login screen
GUI --> Player : display login screen
deactivate GUI

note right of SM
  SessionManager responsibilities:
  - Invalidates session token server-side
  - Clears any locally stored session data
end note

@enduml